# ---- OAuth connectors ----
# One app per provider family. A connector with no client credentials shows as
# "needs setup" on /integrations and refuses to start a handshake — never a
# half-working connection. Full list: docs/spec/04A_CONNECTOR_CATALOG.md
# Tokens are encrypted with TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY above; without it, connecting fails.

# Google Workspace: Gmail, Calendar, Meet, Chat, Docs, Sheets, Drive, Forms, Analytics
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
